concept:criminal-code-amendment-hate-crimes-act-2025-sch-1-sec-11a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "11A Paragraph 80.2B(1)(c) of the Criminal Code"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-11a ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:  Schedule 1  Amendments  Criminal Code Amendment (Hate Crimes) Act 2025 No. 1, 2025 (c) the first person does so because of the first person’s belief that the targeted person is: (i) a member of a group (the targeted group); or (ii) a close associate of a member of a group (the targeted group); and" ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:  Schedule 1  Amendments  Criminal Code Amendment (Hate Crimes) Act 2025 No. 1, 2025 (c) the first person does so because of the first person’s belief that the targeted person is: (i) a member of a group (the targeted group); or (ii) a close associate of a member of a group (the targeted group); and"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "dbe58c47356c10477d44a277247b8c3a33f3b6ba543d04fa5fcf6d512d31d2af" ;
    cof:pageNumber "9"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Repeal paragraph and substitute with new provision prohibiting hate crimes based on group membership or association." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
