    values:originalText "(3) For the purposes of paragraphs (1)(b) and (2)(b), it is immaterial whether the targeted person: (a) actually is a member of the targeted group; or (b) actually is a close associate of a member of the targeted group." ;
    cof:pageNumber "13"^^xsd:integer .

