doc:sch-1-sec-80-5-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "80(2) 2BC  Advocating damage to or destruction of real property or" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) A person (the first person) commits an offence if: (a) the first person advocates the causing of damage to, or the destruction of, real property or a motor vehicle; and (b) the first person does so because of the first person’s belief that: (i) the real property is a place of worship of a group (the targeted group); or (ii) the real property is owned, or occupied, in whole or in part, by one or more members of a group (the targeted group); or (iii) the motor vehicle is owned, or occupied, in whole or in part, by one or more members of a group (the targeted group); or (iv) the real property is owned, or occupied, in whole or in part, by a close associate of one or more members of a group (the targeted group); or (v) the motor vehicle is owned, or occupied, in whole or in part, by a close associate of one or more members of a group (the targeted group); and (c) the first person is reckless as to whether the damage or destruction will occur; and (d) the targeted group is distinguished by race, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, intersex status, disability, nationality, national or ethnic origin or political opinion. Note: For intention, see section 5.2. For recklessness, see section 5.4. Penalty: Imprisonment for 5 years." ;
    cof:pageNumber "15"^^xsd:integer .

concept:criminal-code-amendment-hate-crimes-act-2025-sch-1-sec-80-5-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "80(3) 2BC  Advocating damage to or destruction of real property or"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-80-5-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) For the purposes of paragraphs (1)(b) and (2)(b), it is immaterial whether: (a) the real property actually is a place of worship of the targeted group; or (b) the real property actually is owned, or occupied, in whole or in part, by one or more members of the targeted group; or (c) the motor vehicle actually is owned, or occupied, in whole or in part, by one or more members of the targeted group; or  Amendments  Schedule 1  No. 1, 2025 Criminal Code Amendment (Hate Crimes) Act 2025 (d) the real property actually is owned, or occupied, in whole or in part, by a close associate of one or more members of the targeted group; or (e) the motor vehicle actually is owned, or occupied, in whole or in part, by a close associate of one or more members of the targeted group." ;
    skos:definition "(3) For the purposes of paragraphs (1)(b) and (2)(b), it is immaterial whether: (a) the real property actually is a place of worship of the targeted group; or (b) the real property actually is owned, or occupied, in whole or in part, by one or more members of the targeted group; or (c) the motor vehicle actually is owned, or occupied, in whole or in part, by one or more members of the targeted group; or  Amendments  Schedule 1  No. 1, 2025 Criminal Code Amendment (Hate Crimes) Act 2025 (d) the real property actually is owned, or occupied, in whole or in part, by a close associate of one or more members of the targeted group; or (e) the motor vehicle actually is owned, or occupied, in whole or in part, by a close associate of one or more members of the targeted group."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "da640da5af07edfb294e3f543430317c724baf699955e709adfb3139841c43b6" ;
    values:partOf concept:criminal-code-amendment-hate-crimes-act-2025-sch-1-sec-80-5 ;
    cof:pageNumber "15"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Prohibits damage to or destruction of real property or motor vehicles owned/occupied by targeted group members or close associates." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
