doc:sch-1-sec-80-6-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "80(2) 2BD  Threatening damage to or destruction of real property or" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) A person (the first person) commits an offence if: (a) the first person threatens to cause damage to, or the destruction of, real property or a motor vehicle; and (b) the first person does so because of the first person’s belief that: (i) the real property is a place of worship of a group (the targeted group); or (ii) the real property is owned, or occupied, in whole or in part, by one or more members of a group (the targeted group); or  Amendments  Schedule 1  No. 1, 2025 Criminal Code Amendment (Hate Crimes) Act 2025 (iii) the motor vehicle is owned, or occupied, in whole or in part, by one or more members of a group (the targeted group); or (iv) the real property is owned, or occupied, in whole or in part, by a close associate of one or more members of a group (the targeted group); or (v) the motor vehicle is owned, or occupied, in whole or in part, by a close associate of one or more members of a group (the targeted group); and (c) the targeted group is distinguished by race, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, intersex status, disability, nationality, national or ethnic origin or political opinion; and (d) a reasonable member of the targeted group would fear that the threat will be carried out. Note: For intention, see section 5.2. Penalty: Imprisonment for 5 years." ;
    cof:pageNumber "17"^^xsd:integer .

concept:criminal-code-amendment-hate-crimes-act-2025-sch-1-sec-80-6-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "80(3) 2BD  Threatening damage to or destruction of real property or"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-80-6-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) For the purposes of paragraphs (1)(b) and (2)(b), it is immaterial whether: (a) the real property actually is a place of worship of the targeted group; or (b) the real property actually is owned, or occupied, in whole or in part, by one or more members of the targeted group; or (c) the motor vehicle actually is owned, or occupied, in whole or in part, by one or more members of the targeted group; or (d) the real property actually is owned, or occupied, in whole or in part, by a close associate of one or more members of the targeted group; or (e) the motor vehicle actually is owned, or occupied, in whole or in part, by a close associate of one or more members of the targeted group." ;
    skos:definition "(3) For the purposes of paragraphs (1)(b) and (2)(b), it is immaterial whether: (a) the real property actually is a place of worship of the targeted group; or (b) the real property actually is owned, or occupied, in whole or in part, by one or more members of the targeted group; or (c) the motor vehicle actually is owned, or occupied, in whole or in part, by one or more members of the targeted group; or (d) the real property actually is owned, or occupied, in whole or in part, by a close associate of one or more members of the targeted group; or (e) the motor vehicle actually is owned, or occupied, in whole or in part, by a close associate of one or more members of the targeted group."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "53058e492d971f3a9a8646df0800b3e4e3e7b5c0274cf308796074c5d4cf4944" ;
    values:partOf concept:criminal-code-amendment-hate-crimes-act-2025-sch-1-sec-80-6 ;
    cof:pageNumber "17"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Exemptions from liability for property damage or destruction" ;
