concept:criminal-code-amendment-hate-crimes-act-2025-sch-1-sec-80-6-ss-8 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "80(8) 2BD  Threatening damage to or destruction of real property or"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-80-6-ss-8 ;
    values:originalText "(8) The trier of fact may find the defendant not guilty of the prosecuted offence but guilty of the alternative offence, so long as the defendant has been accorded procedural fairness in relation to that finding of guilt. Definitions" ;
